# ==============================================================================
# Frontend Environment Configuration Template
# Project: Abhishekh Healthcare Consultancy
# ==============================================================================

# Supabase Public API Configuration (Safe for client-side usage)
# Obtain these from: Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings -> API
# 
# 1. Project URL (e.g., https://your-project-id.supabase.co)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co

# 2. Public 'anon' Key (Publicly accessible publishable key)
# NEVER put your service_role secret key here!
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-public-key-here

# ==============================================================================
# Administrative Account Provisioning Instructions:
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Open your Supabase Dashboard: https://supabase.com/dashboard
# 2. Navigate to: Authentication -> Users
# 3. Click "Add User" -> "Create User"
# 4. Enter the administrator's email and a secure password.
# 5. Confirm the user.
# 6. Public self-registration is strictly forbidden on the website.
# 7. Access the admin portal at: http://localhost:3000/admin/login
# ==============================================================================
